{"4076630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HandFoot", "steam_appid": 4076630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From the twisted depths of 80s and 90s trash-horror cinema comes <strong>HandFoot</strong> — a blood-soaked, neon-drenched nightmare where every gun is more than a gun. You play as a hard-boiled private detective investigating a string of disappearances in the decaying industrial sprawl of <strong>Massacre City</strong>. All leads point to a run-down kitten food factory — and what’s inside will change you forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076630/extras/2062f916d4375612217ddbc34b4221cb.poster.avif?t=1788161041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076630/extras/2062f916d4375612217ddbc34b4221cb.webm?t=1788161041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076630/extras/2062f916d4375612217ddbc34b4221cb.mp4?t=1788161041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HandFoot</strong> blends grotesque action, physics-driven combat, and gritty stealth into one chaotic ride.<br>Shoot, smash, throw, and improvise with any weapon in your hands. When bullets aren’t enough, slow time and use your surroundings to turn enemies into debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But violence isn’t always the answer. Crawl through vents, climb across rooftops, and sneak through the shadows to stalk your targets or avoid detection entirely. Solve light environmental puzzles, uncover clues, and piece together the grim mystery behind the factory’s secrets. Whether you fight or hide, every move counts — and every mistake leaves a stain. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076630/extras/529e489e97ef9f232ac9a6c812ac0a13.poster.avif?t=1788161041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076630/extras/529e489e97ef9f232ac9a6c812ac0a13.webm?t=1788161041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076630/extras/529e489e97ef9f232ac9a6c812ac0a13.mp4?t=1788161041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-Time Combat:</strong> Slow down time to unleash cinematic destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Versatility:</strong> Every gun doubles as a melee weapon — shoot, smash, or throw it straight into someone’s skull.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; Exploration:</strong> Hide, climb, crawl, and sneak through dark industrial zones and twisted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles:</strong> Simple but clever challenges that reveal hidden paths and lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grindhouse Aesthetic:</strong> Inspired by 80s–90s trash horror with over-the-top gore, grim humor, and VHS-era attitude.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Gore:</strong> Dismember enemies, blast apart bodies, and paint the walls with chaos.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From the twisted depths of 80s and 90s trash-horror cinema comes <strong>HandFoot</strong> — a blood-soaked, neon-drenched nightmare where every gun is more than a gun. You play as a hard-boiled private detective investigating a string of disappearances in the decaying industrial sprawl of <strong>Massacre City</strong>. All leads point to a run-down kitten food factory — and what’s inside will change you forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076630/extras/2062f916d4375612217ddbc34b4221cb.poster.avif?t=1788161041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076630/extras/2062f916d4375612217ddbc34b4221cb.webm?t=1788161041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076630/extras/2062f916d4375612217ddbc34b4221cb.mp4?t=1788161041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HandFoot</strong> blends grotesque action, physics-driven combat, and gritty stealth into one chaotic ride.<br>Shoot, smash, throw, and improvise with any weapon in your hands. When bullets aren’t enough, slow time and use your surroundings to turn enemies into debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But violence isn’t always the answer. Crawl through vents, climb across rooftops, and sneak through the shadows to stalk your targets or avoid detection entirely. Solve light environmental puzzles, uncover clues, and piece together the grim mystery behind the factory’s secrets. Whether you fight or hide, every move counts — and every mistake leaves a stain. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076630/extras/529e489e97ef9f232ac9a6c812ac0a13.poster.avif?t=1788161041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076630/extras/529e489e97ef9f232ac9a6c812ac0a13.webm?t=1788161041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076630/extras/529e489e97ef9f232ac9a6c812ac0a13.mp4?t=1788161041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-Time Combat:</strong> Slow down time to unleash cinematic destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Versatility:</strong> Every gun doubles as a melee weapon — shoot, smash, or throw it straight into someone’s skull.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; Exploration:</strong> Hide, climb, crawl, and sneak through dark industrial zones and twisted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles:</strong> Simple but clever challenges that reveal hidden paths and lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grindhouse Aesthetic:</strong> Inspired by 80s–90s trash horror with over-the-top gore, grim humor, and VHS-era attitude.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Gore:</strong> Dismember enemies, blast apart bodies, and paint the walls with chaos.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Inspired by 80s and 90s trash horror, HandFoot is a chaotic 3rd person action game where every gun is also a melee weapon. Shoot, smash, throw, climb, and sneak through gore-soaked battles with bullet-time, stealth gameplay, and puzzle-solving along the way.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076630/1fc86f9516ea1c739e5df8cde4ef21f58dafcede/header.jpg?t=1788161041", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a